WEBVTT

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:34.320
Someone, save us!

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:35.690
Right here!

00:01:37.850 --> 00:01:39.630
Matsukichi! Tamekichi!

00:01:39.630 --> 00:01:41.870
<i>Full-Power Slap!</i>

00:01:44.070 --> 00:01:46.160
You take the weak ones!

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:52.840
Not even good enough for a warm-up!

00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:56.590
Always be ready for a fight!

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:05.600
Who are you?

00:02:05.840 --> 00:02:08.100
Give it up, insects!

00:02:09.380 --> 00:02:12.890
We are the Insect Magistrate's Office!

00:02:16.840 --> 00:02:19.450
<b>He Shed His Skin!? 
The Insect-men's True Form!!</b>

00:02:25.400 --> 00:02:28.830
I've h-heard of them, 
the Insect Magistrate's Office.

00:02:29.350 --> 00:02:32.460
They're a magisterial office in 
Edo that fights the insects!

00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:37.370
Wh-Which means that they didn't abandon us!

00:02:38.580 --> 00:02:42.080
The government has come to save us!

00:02:43.980 --> 00:02:45.190
That is correct.

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:49.270
Our goal is to exterminate the insects,

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:52.730
and kill the Insect-man Sanada Yukimura.

00:02:57.300 --> 00:02:58.580
Sanada-dono,

00:02:58.580 --> 00:03:02.240
we would challenge you to combat.

00:03:04.190 --> 00:03:05.440
He dared...

00:03:05.440 --> 00:03:07.240
...speak to Yukimura-sama!

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:12.560
You may decide the rules of the battle.

00:03:12.560 --> 00:03:14.280
You may make it many versus one,

00:03:14.280 --> 00:03:17.810
or set any terms that will confer 
an advantage upon you.

00:03:18.710 --> 00:03:22.260
We do not wish the people to suffer further!

00:03:23.060 --> 00:03:27.260
Why not settle things this way?

00:03:28.070 --> 00:03:31.100
It should be a good deal for you.

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:34.770
I see.

00:03:36.090 --> 00:03:37.270
Foolishness.

00:03:39.320 --> 00:03:42.360
I've no time to waste on such amusements...

00:03:42.970 --> 00:03:44.410
Right now, we are

00:03:44.410 --> 00:03:47.260
in the midst of administering punishment.

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:53.210
You will be eaten, along with 
those you try to protect!

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:58.120
Back to it, insects...

00:03:58.120 --> 00:03:59.670
Devour them all.

00:04:06.910 --> 00:04:09.430
So you're running away?!

00:04:14.630 --> 00:04:17.620
How dare you say that to Yukimura-sama—

00:04:17.620 --> 00:04:20.440
Wait, he hasn't issued our orders.

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:23.700
You claim that I'm running?

00:04:24.110 --> 00:04:26.450
That's right! You're just scared!

00:04:27.940 --> 00:04:29.220
Hey, Sanada...

00:04:29.220 --> 00:04:30.700
I'll tell you what I think.

00:04:31.190 --> 00:04:33.710
I... We...

00:04:34.470 --> 00:04:37.210
think we can beat you with ease!

00:04:37.930 --> 00:04:39.220
You believe

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:43.170
you can defeat us... Me, with ease?

00:04:54.320 --> 00:04:55.840
Interesting...

00:04:55.840 --> 00:04:58.080
You amuse me!

00:04:58.760 --> 00:04:59.980
Very well...

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:03.660
Never have I been told such a thing

00:05:03.660 --> 00:05:07.490
since I became an insect, 
or even when I was human.

00:05:07.770 --> 00:05:11.740
I shall tear you to shreds myself, right here!

00:05:20.940 --> 00:05:21.750
However,

00:05:22.040 --> 00:05:24.410
a lord's retainers must fight before he does,

00:05:24.410 --> 00:05:27.760
to give them the chance to earn glory.

00:05:28.570 --> 00:05:32.640
Thus, you may come to me...

00:05:32.990 --> 00:05:37.140
By defeating my strongest retainers, 
the Ten Crucifix Insects.

00:06:02.350 --> 00:06:03.920
Sounds good to me!

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:07.770
Then I shall ring the bell
to sound the start of battle.

00:06:19.790 --> 00:06:21.440
The m-mountain...

00:06:25.320 --> 00:06:29.700
Don't think for a second that 
you'll make it to me alive.

00:06:34.350 --> 00:06:36.750
Very well, let us go...

00:06:37.030 --> 00:06:38.040
Yeah!

00:06:43.650 --> 00:06:47.760
<i>Up till now, there has been much 
bloodshed in Kishuu Province.</i>

00:06:52.240 --> 00:06:56.930
<i>I must win to avenge their deaths!</i>

00:07:00.820 --> 00:07:02.450
Our escape has been cut off.

00:07:02.450 --> 00:07:05.570
Escape was never an option. 
We must advance!

00:07:06.390 --> 00:07:09.750
Now, then... Everything proceeds to plan.

00:07:09.750 --> 00:07:11.860
But here is where it gets hard.

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:19.480
The Snow Group, with the Magistrate's servant, 
is the plan's most critical component.

00:07:22.220 --> 00:07:25.000
Bizen-dono and the Iwamatsu villagers,

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:28.380
along with Irori-dono, will lead 
the people as the Moon Group.

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:31.910
But the work of the Moon Group, 
and those in the Flower Group,

00:07:31.910 --> 00:07:34.890
is merely to buy time for the Snow 
Group to complete its task.

00:07:35.610 --> 00:07:40.140
Your survival and the fight against 
the Insect-men are irrelevant.

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:45.380
Further, the Snow Group must succeed, 
even if it costs the Moon Group's lives...

00:07:45.380 --> 00:07:48.150
No, the lives of all the people in Kishuu.

00:07:49.510 --> 00:07:51.150
Keep that in mind.

00:07:56.060 --> 00:07:58.010
What's wrong, Hibachi-dono?

00:07:58.010 --> 00:08:01.660
Since we entered the castle, 
I've had a strange feeling.

00:08:03.390 --> 00:08:07.000
<i>Ari mushicha marishiei sowaka.</i>

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:11.430
Wh-What?

00:08:11.430 --> 00:08:12.380
It turned cloudy?

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:20.180
What's going on?

00:08:21.620 --> 00:08:24.690
You have guts to challenge Yukimura-sama...

00:08:26.050 --> 00:08:28.630
<i>Always be ready for a fight!</i>

00:08:29.380 --> 00:08:31.330
<i>Repentance Slash!</i>

00:08:33.820 --> 00:08:35.320
<i>Camellia Sasanqua!</i>

00:08:36.610 --> 00:08:37.990
Matsukichi! Tamekichi!

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:39.900
<i>Full-Power Slap!</i>

00:08:47.180 --> 00:08:48.300
What?

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:50.090
Illusion magic...

00:08:50.540 --> 00:08:53.340
From here on, we don't know what we'll face.

00:08:54.140 --> 00:08:56.260
Everyone, stay together.

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:57.090
Right!

00:08:57.090 --> 00:08:58.070
Let's hurry!

00:09:04.100 --> 00:09:06.100
How beautiful...

00:09:08.330 --> 00:09:09.970
Hibachi-dono?

00:09:09.970 --> 00:09:11.170
Tenma-dono...

00:09:11.170 --> 00:09:12.140
Koikawa-dono?

00:09:12.140 --> 00:09:13.860
Oooka-dono!

00:09:14.690 --> 00:09:17.870
After all they said about not 
getting lost, they got lost...

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:20.910
Did Tsukishima get lost?

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:22.770
We must hurry ahead.

00:09:29.130 --> 00:09:30.840
Hibachi-dono!

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:32.620
You got lost? That's pathetic!

00:09:32.620 --> 00:09:34.130
I've been waiting for you.

00:09:42.230 --> 00:09:43.400
Rat...

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:47.940
I've been waiting endlessly for the time

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:52.070
when we would meet once more.

00:09:48.170 --> 00:09:52.440
<b>Ten Crucifix Insects 
Nedzu Jinpachi</b>

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:56.470
How dare you kill those people at the gate—

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:06.020
My body is that of a water bug.

00:10:06.020 --> 00:10:09.710
Previously, we fought on land,
where you are stronger,

00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:12.090
but the water is where I am stronger.

00:10:16.690 --> 00:10:18.090
<i>The water is so dense...</i>

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:20.590
<i>I can't swing my sword right.</i>

00:10:21.130 --> 00:10:22.600
<i>And there's nowhere to step.</i>

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:30.940
I'll slit you apart.

00:10:32.380 --> 00:10:34.250
Always be ready for a fight!

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:43.120
Magnificent.

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:46.320
You allowed me to knock you into the wall

00:10:46.320 --> 00:10:49.310
so you'd have an anchor for your sword swing?

00:10:50.390 --> 00:10:55.710
But the Ten Crucifix Insects will 
not be defeated by mere rats.

00:10:58.790 --> 00:11:00.970
<i>Crane Wing Egg Formation!</i>

00:11:01.260 --> 00:11:02.970
<i>I've already beaten that technique!</i>

00:11:10.020 --> 00:11:11.250
<i>They turned into bugs?</i>

00:11:22.150 --> 00:11:24.530
I wonder if Tsukishima's okay...

00:11:24.530 --> 00:11:26.270
You know him.

00:11:26.270 --> 00:11:29.700
Right now, he's probably talking 
about how we got lost.

00:11:29.700 --> 00:11:31.640
I hope so.

00:11:31.640 --> 00:11:33.790
Everyone, please be careful!

00:11:36.280 --> 00:11:39.550
Okay, it's my turn now.

00:11:40.240 --> 00:11:42.430
Who the hell are you?

00:11:44.210 --> 00:11:48.270
As the weaker, you must first 
name yourselves... Impudent.

00:11:50.240 --> 00:11:54.420
I am the leader of Sanada's Ten 
Crucifix Insects, Kirigakure Saizou.

00:11:54.910 --> 00:11:58.440
When you say my name,
 use "-sama," maggots.

00:11:59.220 --> 00:12:00.480
He's...

00:12:01.010 --> 00:12:02.580
Kirigakure Saizou...

00:12:02.580 --> 00:12:05.530
I-If he's the leader, wouldn't that 
make him the strongest?

00:12:08.300 --> 00:12:09.660
Perfect...

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:12.920
So I just need to defeat this 
Kirigakure Saizou guy, right?

00:12:14.840 --> 00:12:16.290
Impudent.

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:21.920
I told you to use "-sama," maggot!

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:25.680
What is this sound?

00:12:26.450 --> 00:12:27.800
M-My ears...

00:12:27.800 --> 00:12:29.180
My head is splitting!

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:31.000
I understand...

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:33.940
He must have the body of a cricket.

00:12:34.210 --> 00:12:36.190
Correct.

00:12:40.250 --> 00:12:42.280
Kirigakure Saizou, of Iga.

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:44.360
I never thought I'd meet you.

00:12:45.120 --> 00:12:47.290
Everyone, stand back.

00:12:47.290 --> 00:12:49.870
I will defeat him!

00:12:50.550 --> 00:12:52.110
That kunai...

00:12:52.110 --> 00:12:54.560
Are you also an Iga ninja?

00:12:54.560 --> 00:12:57.080
You seem to know me,

00:12:57.650 --> 00:13:00.750
but you forgot the "-sama," maggot-girl.

00:13:01.410 --> 00:13:03.670
<i>Tsukishima, watch...</i>

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:05.260
<i>This is how I fight.</i>

00:13:10.440 --> 00:13:12.500
T-They vanished...

00:13:12.500 --> 00:13:13.370
Girl!

00:13:14.140 --> 00:13:17.270
Our sole goal is Yukimura.

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:19.020
Do not forget that.

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:20.020
But...

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:22.690
Koikawa-dono, let's go while we can.

00:13:22.690 --> 00:13:24.280
Fine, let's go.

00:13:32.880 --> 00:13:34.000
Farewell.

00:13:35.520 --> 00:13:40.470
<i>Tsukishima-style: Mt. Fuji Hammer!</i>

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:45.420
Wh-What?

00:14:07.010 --> 00:14:08.620
I never thought

00:14:08.620 --> 00:14:14.500
I'd see such a samurai in this 
decadent land of Edo...

00:14:15.300 --> 00:14:17.290
Is this the end?

00:14:37.750 --> 00:14:39.010
Wh-What?

00:14:39.010 --> 00:14:40.270
He transformed?

00:14:41.760 --> 00:14:44.590
My lord, I beg your forgiveness

00:14:44.590 --> 00:14:48.570
for being so weak as to 
reveal myself to a mere rat!

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:53.280
I shall apologize by slitting my own stomach.

00:14:53.280 --> 00:14:54.030
But...

00:14:58.550 --> 00:15:01.460
He's much faster than when he was an insect...

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:04.800
Before I do, I shall take this rat with me!

00:15:09.130 --> 00:15:12.500
Don't imagine that being on land 
will give you an advantage.

00:15:12.500 --> 00:15:14.490
That would be foolish.

00:15:17.800 --> 00:15:19.440
<i>Water God's Army.</i>

00:15:22.390 --> 00:15:23.550
Wh-What?

00:15:33.220 --> 00:15:35.780
Water is mine to control.

00:15:36.390 --> 00:15:40.710
This is the secret technique of Nedzu Jinpachi,
 of the Ten Crucifix Insects!

00:15:40.890 --> 00:15:42.280
<i>What?</i>

00:15:42.280 --> 00:15:44.810
<i>He can control water?</i>

00:15:44.810 --> 00:15:45.710
<i>Then...</i>

00:15:48.360 --> 00:15:52.630
You cannot escape my technique.

00:15:54.140 --> 00:15:56.010
<i>Water God's Army!</i>

00:16:00.070 --> 00:16:00.910
<i>What?</i>

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:05.830
<i>Tsukishima-style: Mt. Fuji—</i>

00:16:26.770 --> 00:16:28.130
Tsukishima...

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:33.670
Fighting you is so enjoyable.

00:16:33.670 --> 00:16:35.640
It reminds me of the old days.

00:16:36.190 --> 00:16:39.810
I have been very disappointed 
with this era's samurai...

00:16:39.810 --> 00:16:44.530
They are ugly and weak, only interested 
in flaunting their position.

00:16:45.300 --> 00:16:47.650
Decadent and rotten to the core.

00:16:48.340 --> 00:16:52.380
But in you, I feel the heat of the battlefield

00:16:52.380 --> 00:16:55.160
whence I was birthed...

00:16:55.850 --> 00:16:58.630
However, it is a useless heat.

00:16:58.630 --> 00:17:01.920
You cannot beat me anywhere that water flows.

00:17:01.920 --> 00:17:05.920
And you do not even realize that 
it flows from high to low ground.

00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:09.930
<i>The flow of the water...</i>

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:19.870
<i>The flow of the water...</i>

00:17:21.270 --> 00:17:23.090
<i>Please, Father...</i>

00:17:23.090 --> 00:17:25.890
<i>Give me but a word on how 
to use the Mt. Fuji Storm!</i>

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:29.400
<i>F-Father, please!</i>

00:17:30.790 --> 00:17:33.150
<i>Jinbei, I'll give you one hint.</i>

00:17:35.810 --> 00:17:36.800
<i>Listen...</i>

00:17:37.220 --> 00:17:40.490
<i>The Mt. Fuji Storm's most important element</i>

00:17:40.490 --> 00:17:42.250
<i>is to read the flow and grab it!</i>

00:17:43.590 --> 00:17:46.670
<i>Read the flow and grab it, huh?</i>

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:50.920
I shall release you from your suffering.

00:17:55.700 --> 00:17:57.580
This is the end.

00:17:58.180 --> 00:18:00.100
You were my toughest opponent in a long time.

00:18:00.800 --> 00:18:02.620
<i>Water God's Army!</i>

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:21.570
<i>Tsukishima-style:</i>

00:18:25.350 --> 00:18:26.470
<i>Mt. Fuji...</i>

00:18:29.900 --> 00:18:32.000
<i>Storm!</i>

00:18:38.270 --> 00:18:39.840
Wh-What is this?

00:18:43.910 --> 00:18:47.600
He's using the flow of my Water 
God's Army to his advantage?

00:18:48.420 --> 00:18:50.660
<i>Everything in this world has a flow.</i>

00:18:51.160 --> 00:18:52.820
<i>The river has a flow.</i>

00:18:52.960 --> 00:18:54.570
<i>The fire has its own.</i>

00:18:54.890 --> 00:18:56.610
<i>The storm, its own.</i>

00:18:56.880 --> 00:18:59.020
<i>And a sword strike, as well.</i>

00:18:59.020 --> 00:19:01.390
<i>Each of these flows has its own will.</i>

00:19:02.240 --> 00:19:03.180
<i>Yes...</i>

00:19:03.180 --> 00:19:05.510
<i>The role of the Tsukishima-style Mt. Fuji Storm</i>

00:19:05.510 --> 00:19:09.070
<i>is a counter-technique that reads 
the flow of your opponent's strike,</i>

00:19:09.070 --> 00:19:10.770
<i>so you can knock it away.</i>

00:19:11.460 --> 00:19:14.200
<i>He who masters the fourth of 
Mt. Fuji's thirty-six blades,</i>

00:19:14.200 --> 00:19:17.000
<i>the Mt. Fuji Storm,</i>

00:19:17.000 --> 00:19:20.220
<i>can control every flow on the battlefield.</i>

00:19:22.710 --> 00:19:24.380
<i>Tsukishima-style:</i>

00:19:25.220 --> 00:19:28.030
<i>Rising Dragon!</i>

00:19:51.210 --> 00:19:56.340
I c-cannot believe a mere rat defeated me.

00:19:56.880 --> 00:20:00.600
But do not get arrogant, rat.

00:20:01.410 --> 00:20:04.600
I am but the sixth among 
the Ten Crucifix Insects.

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:08.600
I am only a foot soldier.

00:20:09.190 --> 00:20:15.900
The others—especially our leader, 
Kirigakure Saizou-sama,

00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:18.320
the second, Yuri Kamanosuke-dono,

00:20:19.170 --> 00:20:24.800
and the third, Kakei Juuzou-dono—all await...

00:20:24.800 --> 00:20:27.910
As a samurai, I am still inexperienced,

00:20:27.910 --> 00:20:30.120
but your fighting was splendid.

00:20:31.220 --> 00:20:32.370
You...

00:20:32.950 --> 00:20:35.770
I must hurry...

00:20:35.770 --> 00:20:37.500
Farewell.

00:20:40.060 --> 00:20:43.950
I am so sorry, master.

00:20:44.500 --> 00:20:47.570
I have served and respected you for many years,

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:50.390
but this appears to be the end...

00:20:50.960 --> 00:20:52.790
I am f-filled with regret...

00:20:53.290 --> 00:20:57.950
But the samurai of this era are 
stronger than I had believed.

00:21:00.810 --> 00:21:02.900
Tsukishima Jinbei...

00:21:09.550 --> 00:21:13.810
Everyone, where have you gotten lost?

00:21:19.880 --> 00:21:21.050
Hibachi-dono!

00:21:25.160 --> 00:21:29.850
<b>Ten Crucifix Insects 
Kirigakure Saizou</b>

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:02.310
<b>Next Time</b>

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:02.310
I can't believe Hibachi-dono got caught...

00:23:02.310 --> 00:23:03.810
You must be a fake.

00:23:03.810 --> 00:23:08.200
Hibachi-dono, if that's really you, 
please name your ninjutsu style!

00:23:08.200 --> 00:23:09.640
Ch-Ch-Chin...

00:23:09.640 --> 00:23:10.560
I can't say it!

00:23:11.370 --> 00:23:12.530
Next time, on <i>Mushibugyo</i>:

00:23:11.740 --> 00:23:14.000
<b>Dream of the Butterfly.</b>

00:23:12.530 --> 00:23:14.000
Dream of the Butterfly.
